build/

# The brain injected into itself by `npm run inject:self`. Everything the build owns is derivable
# from the sources, so it stays out of git to avoid a second committed copy of every skill and rule.
# .agent-brain/
.agent-brain/ORG.md
.agent-brain/agents-reports/
.agent-brain/references/
.agent-brain/service-docs-template/
.agent-brain/docs/library/
.agent-brain/control-plane/
.agent-brain/injected.json
.claude/agents/
.claude/skills/
.claude/commands/
.claude/settings.json
.mcp.json

# What the build only seeds is real content and is committed: the global docs the organization
# maintains (.agent-brain/docs/*.md) and the per-service documents its EMs own
# (.agent-brain/services/**). The live control-plane database is ignored above.
